# Najdi Social Backend

REST API for a social media platform with four account types:
admin, supervisor, normal user and business page.

## Tech stack
Django, Django REST Framework, PostgreSQL, Redis, JWT, Docker

## Quick start
    cp .env.example .env
    docker compose up --build
    docker compose exec web python manage.py migrate
    docker compose exec web python manage.py createsuperuser

API runs at http://localhost:8000 — health check at /api/health/

## Running tests
    docker compose exec web pytest

